      "text": "Join H1, H2, H3, H4, H5 and H6 with straight lines. H1 to H6 are where the three lines cross the first circle. This hexagon stands on a corner. Join A, B, C, D, E and F with straight lines. This hexagon lies on its side and is the tile. The two hexagons cross at X1 to X12.",
      "create": {
