      "text": "Draw a straight line through X2 and X11. Draw a straight line through X4 and X1. Draw a straight line through X6 and X3. Draw a straight line through X8 and X5. Draw a straight line through X10 and X7. Draw a straight line through X12 and X9. These are the hammerhead lines.",
